OL,3,AAmerican soldier arrested in UK taken
OL,4,Ainto US military custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US Army officer arrested in the UK on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of spying for Russia earlier
OL,8,Fthis month has been taken into US
OL,9,Fmilitary custody, British
OL,10,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,12,FThe 41-year-old senior serviceman was
OL,13,Farrested near Gloucester last week by
OL,14,FBritish counter-terror police.
OL,16,FHe was based at Imjin Barracks in
OL,17,FInnsworth, Gloucestershire, the BBC
OL,18,Funderstands, which serves as the
OL,19,Fheadquarters of Nato's Allied Rapid
OL,20,FReaction Corps (ARRC).
